(individual route authors remembering to set them. The secret guard is layered: gitleaks runs) Tj
T*
(when available, and the bundled fallback still catches common provider token families when) Tj
T*
(gitleaks is not installed. Reports and console output are redacted. The hook is versioned) Tj
T*
(and documented. CI now repeats the most important portable checks so the reviewer sees) Tj
T*
(ongoing enforcement, not only a one-time local scan. Cross-platform wrappers make the) Tj
